          "modulo": "freeman-manners-customs"
        },
        "texto": "The ugab was one of the most ancient instruments, its invention being ascribed to Jubal (Gen. 4:21). From Job 21:12 and Job 30:31 it appears to have been used on festive occasions. In the text it is spoken of as appropriate for use in the worship of God. Various opinions have bee…",
